    <div class="shift-footer">
      <div class="shift-callout reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="callout-label">Key Insight</div>
        <div class="callout-text">Public CA standard today &mdash; internal CA best practice tomorrow.</div>
        <div class="callout-sub">The same expectation follows for your private CA, service mesh, and internal APIs. For a 1,000-cert fleet, renewals jump <strong>8&times;</strong> by 2029.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="shift-conclusion reveal reveal-delay-5">
        <p class="shift-insight">Manual processes cannot scale to 47-day cycles &mdash; automation becomes non-negotiable.</p>
        <p class="shift-source">Source: CA/Browser Forum Ballot SC-081, April 2025</p>
      </div>
